{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmxuHFfVUQ79rBwWp9j6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll go with Psagot, the פסגות ניירות ערך account, and buy the אי.בי.אי. מחקה (4A) ת\"א 125 fund, number 5112628. I'm fairly sure. What decided it was the top card: \"הבחירה שלכם · ★ הזול\", 86,045 ₪ after 10 years, which beat every other pairing. The page's own example puts in 10,000 ₪ now plus 500 ₪ a month, 70,000 ₪ in total. I didn't change those fields. My real start would be 30,000, so my end number would come out bigger. I just didn't see it.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n1. **Top heading:** \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\". ת\"א-125 was already picked. The fields showed \"סכום היום 10,000\", \"הפקדה חודשית 500\" and \"תשואה בשנה 7%\".\n2. **The big card:** \"הפקדתם 70,000 ₪\", then 86,045 against 85,015 for \"הזוג הבא בתור\". That click was easy.\n3. **Cost summary:** a coloured bar. I skimmed \"הקרן 1,390 ₪ פחות\".\n4. **Account list:** Psagot is first. \"לאומי 82,968\" is second, and it's Leumi, a bank I know. Then a long run of banks, each with a \"לא בחישוב\" tag and a fold. Further down, אקסלנס and מיטב טרייד are around 63k with big red parts on their bars. The red put me off them.\n5. **Fund list:** the chosen fund is \"קרן מחקה\", fees \"0.1%\". The others are קרנות סל, each about 1,030 ₪ or more behind.\n6. **\"What changes the result\" chart:** I glanced at it and saw \"12 שנים\" gives \"18,905 ₪ יותר\".\n7. **Step chart:** it starts from הראל סל on ירושלים at 79,910, then \"+5,022 ₪\" for switching to Psagot, then \"+1,113 ₪\" for this fund. Same answer, so I stopped there.\n\n**What I skipped:** the \"כל החשבונות\" small print, the \"מול המדד\" paragraph, the folds on each bank, and screens 11 to 13.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"נאמן 0.025%\", \"דמי משמרת\", \"העמלות זו על זו\", \"הפס נחתך: הסכום ארוך מהשטח\", \"מחזיקה את המניות\", and \"כמה דרכים יחד\".\n\n**What bugged me:**\n- **The chosen fund shows \"−0.04%\".** It's a minus on the fund I'm picking, I don't know what it means, and it scared me a bit.\n- **\"−1,030 ₪ לעומת הבחירה שלכם\":** at first I read that minus as losing money.\n- **The colour key comes after the whole list of 15 accounts.** I had to guess the colours while scrolling, and I thought the red was some big fee.\n- **The same \"לא בחישוב מחיר אחר לצעירים, לחיילים…\" sits on almost every bank.** It's under 26, which is me, so maybe I'd pay less somewhere. But reading the same line on every card got tiring.\n- **I'd never heard of the fund manager \"אי.בי.אי.\"** I hesitated, but it's the cheapest, so fine."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1861,"cache_read_input_tokens":21070,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1861},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d08f15c6-f041-414e-9aa3-b4140645808b","uuid":"d0af39f3-9f35-4635-9937-95f538b3f76b","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:09:20.727Z","request_id":"req_011CgmxuH32Hd32LDFfAQqob"}
